## Quick Start

```bash
# Install dependencies
uv sync

# Run tests
uv run pytest

# Lint + format
uv run ruff check .
uv run ruff format .

# Type check
uv run mypy src/
```

## Development

### Prerequisites

- [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) (Python package manager)
- Python {{ python_version }}+
{%- if use_databricks %}
- [Databricks CLI](https://docs.databricks.com/en/dev-tools/cli/index.html)
{%- endif %}

### Setup

```bash
# Install all dependencies (including dev)
uv sync --all-extras --dev

# Install pre-commit hooks
uv run pre-commit install
```
{%- if use_dbt %}

### dbt

```bash
# Install dbt dependencies
uv run --group dbt dbt deps --project-dir dbt/

# Run dbt models
uv run --group dbt dbt build --project-dir dbt/
```
{%- endif %}
{%- if use_terraform %}

### Terraform

```bash
cd terraform/
terraform init
terraform plan
```
{%- endif %}
{%- if use_databricks %}

### Databricks

```bash
# Login
databricks auth login

# Validate bundle
databricks bundle validate

# Deploy
databricks bundle deploy -t dev
```
{%- endif %}

